Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.59,0:00:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Puff is my idol, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.59,0:00:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Puff Daddyは俺のアイドルなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, that's why I said, I was like, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だから言ったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I know how Virgil feels now, on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the times that I scream at Virgil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今ならVirgilの気持ちがわかるって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺がVirgilを怒鳴った時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}especially if I scream at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Virgil in front of somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}特に人前で怒鳴った時のな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}わかるだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Well, for Puff to call me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and say anybody with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Puff Daddyが電話してきて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}「White Lives MatterのTシャツ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}a White Lives Matter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}t-shirt is getting greenlit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}着てる奴は誰でも狙われる」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}言われた時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I know how Virgil felt at that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}あの時のVirgilの気持ちがわかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}if I ever said something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}where his idol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}憧れの人に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}said something that hurt his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}傷つくことを言われた気持ちがな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And, you know, and that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Virgil took the watch to Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だからVirgilは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Drakeに時計を作ったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying? He
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}knew that would hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺が傷つくって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかっててな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, we hurt each other's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}feelings, and we don't mean to,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺らはお互い傷つけ合ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}そんなつもりはなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but part of the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}why we hurt each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもそうなる理由は…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I want to address that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そこ確認したいんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You said Virgil took
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the watch from Drake,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}VirgilがDrakeから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}時計を取ったって言った？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because Virgil actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}designed a Patek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}実際はVirgilが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Patekをデザインしたんだよな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Oh, well, Virgil, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Virgil took the watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ああ、悪い
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Virgilが時計を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}sent the watch to Drake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and all that type of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Drakeに送ったとか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}そういうことだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because he knew that, like, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}know, that would hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺が傷つくって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかっててな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I work with Balenciaga because I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺がBalenciagaと組んだのも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}knew it would hurt Drake's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Drakeが傷つくって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}わかってたからだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So we're operating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}like I said, it's 4D chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺らは　言ってみれば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:56.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}4次元チェスをやってたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You guys are playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}crazy games, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}お前らヤバいゲームしてんな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, you know what I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}saying? This is like real war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}マジの戦争なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is psychological. Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Virgil was a psychological warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}心理戦だよ　Virgilは　心理戦の戦士だった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}He was a warrior, bro.
