Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}assistant to the head
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of Louis Vuitton.
